# Beastrider Vanguard, {1}{G} 2/2: "{4}{G}: Look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal a permanent card from among them
# and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 and activates it on
# turn 3 with five Moxen (one green source, exactly {4}{G}: the pool is empty afterwards). The top three are Lightning Bolt, Grizzly Bears and
# Ornithopter; the card below them (Plains) is not looked at. A permanent card is any that is not an instant or sorcery (CR 110.4a): the
# Bolt cannot be taken, and only one card may be (the Ornithopter as well is refused). The Grizzly Bears is revealed and taken, and the
# Ornithopter and the Bolt go to the bottom in the order chosen (CR 401.4), the Bolt lowest.

